nother galaxy.<br>If you\u2019re new to tower defense games, Faith &amp; Shield: 4044 is fairly easy, making it the perfect intro to a world you\u2019ll soon love.<br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960060/extras/673087fe5cdee3bc3080b249725dc062.poster.avif?t=1673022053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960060/extras/673087fe5cdee3bc3080b249725dc062.webm?t=1673022053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960060/extras/673087fe5cdee3bc3080b249725dc062.mp4?t=1673022053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Features:<br>-Epic defense battles that will hook you for hours<br>-Towers with different attack types and many upgrades<br>-A large number of unique enemies<br>-Strategy matters and plays an important role<br>-Beautiful and vibrant visual effects and high-quality graphics<br>-Increasing difficulty on each level<br>-Spectacular cinematic cut scenes",
